  "title": "Congress Trades"
 },
 "description": "Returns official financial disclosures from Congress and the OGE executive-branch feed. It defaults to Congress; branch selects Congress, executive, or both. Optionally filter by one stock or one official filer.\n\nWHEN TO USE: User asks what Congress, a senator, a representative, or an executive-branch official disclosed buying or selling.\nExamples:\n  - \"What stocks did Nancy Pelosi trade?\"\n  - \"What did Donald Trump disclose trading?\"\n  - \"Has any member of Congress bought NVDA?\"\n  - \"Show me recent congressional purchases\"\n\nPARAMETERS:\n  - ticker_or_cusip or member: optional identity filter; provide at most one. member resolves only against the selected branch; ambiguous names return candidates\n  - branch: congress (default), executive (OGE), or all official disclosures\n  - direction: optional buy, sell, or other filter\n  - filed_from / filed_to: optional inclusive disclosure-date range (YYYY-MM-DD); filed_from must be on or before filed_to\n  - limit / cursor: page size and opaque continuation cursor; an explicit limit above the caller's tier fails rather than being changed\n\nWHEN NOT TO USE:\n  - Use analyze_politician for one member's full profile + trading performance\n  - Use analyze_stock for the synthesized smart-money verdict on a stock\n\nRETURNS: Cursor-paginated House, Senate, and/or OGE disclosures (selected by branch) with canonical ticker and CUSIP when verified, the ticker printed in the official disclosure as separate source evidence, filer, chamber, native transaction type, buy/sell/other direction, dollar range, dates, instrument details, and source link. An unresolved official ticker is returned as disclosed_ticker while ticker and security_cusip remain null.\n\nVERIFICATION: Cite record-level `source_url` filing or disclosure links when present.",
 "inputSchema": {
  "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "not": {
   "anyOf": [
    {
     "required": [
      "ticker_or_cusip",
      "member"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  "properties": {
   "branch": {
    "default": "congress",
    "enum": [
     "congress",
     "executive",
     "all"
    ],
    "type": "string"
   },
   "cursor": {
    "maxLength": 500,
    "type": "string"
   },
   "direction": {
    "enum": [
     "buy",
     "sell",
     "other"
    ],
    "type": "string"
   },
   "filed_from": {
    "format": "date",
    "type": "string"
   },
   "filed_to": {
    "format": "date",
    "type": "string"
   },
   "limit": {
    "maximum": 50,
    "minimum": 1,
    "type": "integer"
   },
   "member": {
    "maxLength": 80,
    "minLength": 1,
    "type": "string"
   },
   "ticker_or_cusip": {
    "maxLength": 20,
    "minLength": 1,
    "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9./\\-]+$",
    "type": "string"
   }
  },
  "type": "object"
 },
 "name": "get_congress_trades",
